hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15623","Rawh narrated to us, he said: Ibn Jurayj informed us, he said: Muhammad ibn Talhah ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman informed me, from his father Talhah ibn Abdullah, from Muawiyah ibn Jahimah, that he came to the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, and said: O Messenger of Allah, I intended to go to battle and I came to you to consult you. He said: Do you have a mother. He said: Yes. He said: Stay with her, for Paradise is at her foot. Then a second time, then a third time, in different sittings, with like this saying."
